  id: ear_forewarning
  displayName: Forewarning
  description: 'Listen. For a breath you hear the blow before it lands: if a foe strikes you in that moment, the blow never touches you - you step out of the air behind it and cut once, at twice your blade''s strength. Blows from afar are not heard in time. The Ear mantras are attuned together: they take all three sockets.'
